Apple is no longer signing iOS 26.6.2, so if you've upgraded to <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ios-27/">iOS 27</a>, there is no option to downgrade to a version of <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ios-26/">iOS 26</a>. &zwnj;iOS 27&zwnj; <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/14/apple-releases-ios-27/">came out a week ago</a>.<br/>
<br/>
